 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제2차 시험 : ‘12. 12. 21(금) 14:00 ~ 17:35</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 시험 장소 : 전국 80여개 시험장</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 접수 기간 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> ‘12. 11. 15(목) ~ 11. 26(월) 오전 10:00 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 추가 원서 접수 기간 : '12.11.22(목) ~ 11.26(월)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 접수 방법 : NEAT 1급 홈페이지(www.neat.go.kr) 인터넷 접수</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 응시료 : 무료 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사. 응시자 선정 및 발표 : ‘12. 11. 27(화)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span style=\"